isos)) </ts></ts><ts n="sc" id="Seg_1865" s="T15" e="T16"><ts n="e" id="Seg_1867" s="T15" e="T114">Eu esqueci-me do tema que tinha agora. </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_1869" s="T114" e="T16">N/ • não me lembro qual era o tema, • ehm, </ts></ts><ts n="sc" id="Seg_1870" s="T17" e="T86"><ts n="e" id="Seg_1872" s="T17" e="T18">porque eu ando transtornado. </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_1874" s="T18" e="T20">• • Eu ando transtornado com o seguinte. </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_1876" s="T20" e="T23">• • • É muito complicado • encontrar batatas fritas que saibam a batata frita hoje em dia. </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_1878" s="T23" e="T2">• • É mesmo complicado. </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_1880" s="T2" e="T29">• • Há batata frita que sabe a queijo, • • batata frita que sabe a cebola, • • batata frita que sabe a presunto, batata frita que sabe a barbecue. </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_1882" s="T29" e="T33">• • Mas, eh, batatas que saibam a boa batata é muito complicado • • encontrar. </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_1884" s="T33" e="T35">• • E depois, eu questiono por exemplo, batata frita com sabor a barbecue. </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_1886" s="T35" e="T95">Não.</ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_1888" s="T95" e="T96">• • Não, não. </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_1890" s="T96" e="T36">• Não, não pá! </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_1892" s="T36" e="T38">• • Não, porque eles não dizem é barbecue de/ de peixe, ou barbecue de carne, ou es/ estas sabem a barbecue de frango. </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_1894" s="T38" e="T39">Não, é só a barbecue. </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_1896" s="T39" e="T40">• Ora, barbecue é, uh, uma coiso em que se faz o grelhado. </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_1898" s="T40" e="T42">• • Ne? </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_1900" s="T42" e="T44">• • E as batatas sabem àquilo. </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_1902" s="T44" e="T46">• • • Eh, é basicamente outra maneira dizer n/ batatas com sabor a fumo. </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_1904" s="T46" e="T47">• Eh, as batatas sabem a fumo. </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_1906" s="T47" e="T48">• Põe aí barbecue, • que a malta come. </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_1908" s="T48" e="T52">• • • E é isto agora por tod/ • a comida toda, comida que sabe a outra comida, • • todo o lado • • todo o lado. </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_1910" s="T52" e="T92">• • • Eh • águas! </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_1912" s="T92" e="T55">• As águas agora eh • água • com sabor a morango. </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_1914" s="T55" e="T94">• Não! </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_1916" s="T94" e="T56">• • Não! </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_1918" s="T56" e="T97">• • Não á água! </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_1920" s="T97" e="T57">Atenção! </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_1922" s="T57" e="T58">• Água é eu vou só/ só uma coisa • aqui para os senhores das águas. </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_1924" s="T58" e="T61">• • • Ora bom • água, • • água. </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_1926" s="T61" e="T98">• • • Dicionário. </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_1928" s="T98" e="T63">• Água,• água. </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_1930" s="T63" e="T65">• • Líquido incolor e transparente, insípido e inodoro.</ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_1932" s="T65" e="T64">Significa, não sabe a nada, nem cheira a nada. </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_1934" s="T64" e="T99">• Água com sabor? </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_1936" s="T99" e="T66">Não! </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_1938" s="T66" e="T68">• • • Ah, mas este vem com sabor, não é água. </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_1940" s="T68" e="T93">• • • Esta água é com sabor a quê? </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_1942" s="T93" e="T70">A nada, é água.</ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_1944" s="T70" e="T100">• • • É com sabora a que? </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_1946" s="T100" e="T101">Morango? </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_1948" s="T101" e="T72">Não é água! </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_1950" s="T72" e="T73">• • Não é água! </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_1952" s="T73" e="T74">• • • Água com sabor • • não é água. </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_1954" s="T74" e="T75">• • • Pft, • • não é água! </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_1956" s="T75" e="T102">• • Não é água! </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_1958" s="T102" e="T103">• • Não é • água!</ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_1960" s="T103" e="T76">• • Tá bem? </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_1962" s="T76" e="T78">• • • Por exemplo, há iogurtes agora, iogurtes que é iogurte de chocolate com • • piri-píri. </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_1964" s="T78" e="T3">• ((risos)) </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_1966" s="T3" e="T104">Ah, requinte, o requinte, • chocolate com picante. </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_1968" s="T104" e="T105">Pá, isto é requinte. </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_1970" s="T105" e="T80">Não é.</ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_1972" s="T80" e="T106">• Não é requinte. </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_1974" s="T106" e="T107">É jabardeira. </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_1976" s="T107" e="T81">• • • Tá bem? </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_1978" s="T81" e="T82">• • Sabem onde é que há também esse requinte, estas misturas de sabores?</ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_1980" s="T82" e="T83">• • Nos sítios onde os porcos comem.</ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_1982" s="T83" e="T84">• • • Que vai tudo para lá. </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_1984" s="T84" e="T85">Olha, ohh, sobrou chocolate, põe pra o porco. </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_1986" s="T85" e="T108">• O que é que eu faço com este picante? </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_1988" s="T108" e="T86">Põe também para o porco.</ts></ts><ts n="sc" id="Seg_1989" s="T109" e="T87"><ts n="e" id="Seg_1991" s="T109" e="T87">E é o que há lá? </ts></ts><ts n="sc" id="Seg_1992" s="T110" e="T88"><ts n="e" id="Seg_1994" s="T110" e="T111">Os porcalhões. </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_1996" s="T111" e="T112">É isso. </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_1998" s="T112" e="T88">• ((incompreensível))</ts></ts><ts n="sc" id="Seg_1999" s="T89" e="T1"><ts n="e" id="Seg_2001" s="T89" e="T113">Não é água! </ts><ts n="e" id="Seg_2003" s="T113" e="T1">Não é água! </ts></ts></segmentation><annotation name="en" tierref="TIE1"><ta id="Seg_2004" s="T0" e="T5">Hello, today I found it absolutely neccessary to come speak to you about a topic • that occured to me the other day that is. </ta><ta id="Seg_2005" s="T5" e="T13">• • Have you ever noticed (how), • sometimes, • • there's a given situation, • • and a person appears • • with a certain behaviour that is inconsistent • • with the situation that person is in! </ta><ta id="Seg_2006" s="T13" e="T14">((laughs)) </ta><ta id="Seg_2007" s="T15" e="T114">Now I forgot the topic I had. </ta><ta id="Seg_2008" s="T114" e="T16">I don/ • don't remember the topic, • um, </ta><ta id="Seg_2009" s="T17" e="T18">because I've been troubled. </ta><ta id="Seg_2010" s="T18" e="T20">• • I've been troubled by the following. </ta><ta id="Seg_2011" s="T20" e="T23">• • • It is very difficult • to find french fries that taste like french fries in this day and age. </ta><ta id="Seg_2012" s="T23" e="T2">• • It is really difficult. </ta><ta id="Seg_2013" s="T2" e="T29">• • There are french fries that taste like cheese, • • french fries that taste like onion, • • french fries that taste like ham, barbecue-flavoured french fries. </ta><ta id="Seg_2014" s="T29" e="T33">• • But, um, finding french fries that taste like a good potato is very • • difficult. </ta><ta id="Seg_2015" s="T33" e="T35">• • And then I questioned french fries with barbecue flavour, for example. </ta><ta id="Seg_2016" s="T35" e="T95">No. </ta><ta id="Seg_2017" s="T95" e="T96">• • No, no. </ta><ta id="Seg_2018" s="T96" e="T36">• No, no way! </ta><ta id="Seg_2019" s="T36" e="T38">• • No, because they don't say whether it's barbecued fish or barbecued meat, or whether it/ it's barbecued chicken. </ta><ta id="Seg_2020" s="T38" e="T39">No, it's just barbecued. </ta><ta id="Seg_2021" s="T39" e="T40">• Now, barbecue is a thing, um, in which you can grill things. </ta><ta id="Seg_2022" s="T40" e="T42">• • Yes? </ta><ta id="Seg_2023" s="T42" e="T44">• • And the potatoes taste like it. </ta><ta id="Seg_2024" s="T44" e="T46">• • • Um, it's basically another of saying n/ potatoes with smoke flavour. </ta><ta id="Seg_2025" s="T46" e="T47">• Um, potatoes that taste like smoke. </ta><ta id="Seg_2026" s="T47" e="T48">• Put it on the grill, • and people will eat it. </ta><ta id="Seg_2027" s="T48" e="T52">• • • And it's the same for a/ , • all food today, food that tastes like other food, • • everywhere, • • everywhere. </ta><ta id="Seg_2028" s="T52" e="T92">• • • Uhm, • Water! </ta><ta id="Seg_2029" s="T92" e="T55">• The water of today, uhm, • water • with strawberry flavour. </ta><ta id="Seg_2030" s="T55" e="T94">• No! </ta><ta id="Seg_2031" s="T94" e="T56">• • No! </ta><ta id="Seg_2032" s="T56" e="T97">• • Not in the water! </ta><ta id="Seg_2033" s="T97" e="T57">Listen up! </ta><ta id="Seg_2034" s="T57" e="T58">• Water is only/ only a thing of the lords of the water. </ta><ta id="Seg_2035" s="T58" e="T61">• • • But well, • water, • • water. </ta><ta id="Seg_2036" s="T61" e="T98">• • • Dictionary. </ta><ta id="Seg_2037" s="T98" e="T63">• Water, • water. </ta><ta id="Seg_2038" s="T63" e="T65">• • Colourless, transparent, tasteless and odourless liquid. </ta><ta id="Seg_2039" s="T65" e="T64">This means you don't taste anything or smell anything. </ta><ta id="Seg_2040" s="T64" e="T99">• Water with flavour? </ta><ta id="Seg_2041" s="T99" e="T66">No! </ta><ta id="Seg_2042" s="T66" e="T68">• • • Ah, but that type that comes with a flavour, isn't water. </ta><ta id="Seg_2043" s="T68" e="T93">• • • This water tastes like what? </ta><ta id="Seg_2044" s="T93" e="T70">Like nothing, it's water. </ta><ta id="Seg_2045" s="T70" e="T100">• • • And with what flavour? </ta><ta id="Seg_2046" s="T100" e="T101">Strawberry? </ta><ta id="Seg_2047" s="T101" e="T72">That's not water! </ta><ta id="Seg_2048" s="T72" e="T73">• • That's not water! </ta><ta id="Seg_2049" s="T73" e="T74"> • • • Water with a flavour • • is not water. </ta><ta id="Seg_2050" s="T74" e="T75">• • • Pft, • • it's not water! </ta><ta id="Seg_2051" s="T75" e="T102">• • It's not water! </ta><ta id="Seg_2052" s="T102" e="T103">• • It's not • water! </ta><ta id="Seg_2053" s="T103" e="T76">• • Understood? </ta><ta id="Seg_2054" s="T76" e="T78">• • • There's yoghurt today, for example, yoghurt that is chocolate-flavoured yoghurt • • with tabasco. </ta><ta id="Seg_2055" s="T78" e="T3">• ((laughs)) </ta><ta id="Seg_2056" s="T3" e="T104">Ah, sophistication, what sophistication, • spicy chocolate. </ta><ta id="Seg_2057" s="T104" e="T105">Sure, this is sophisticated. </ta><ta id="Seg_2058" s="T105" e="T80">It's not. </ta><ta id="Seg_2059" s="T80" e="T106">• It's not sophisticated. </ta><ta id="Seg_2060" s="T106" e="T107">It's an atrocity. </ta><ta id="Seg_2061" s="T107" e="T81">• • • Understood? </ta><ta id="Seg_2062" s="T81" e="T82">• • Do you know where else they have that kind of sophistication, those mixes of flavour? </ta><ta id="Seg_2063" s="T82" e="T83">• • In places where pigs eat. </ta><ta id="Seg_2064" s="T83" e="T84">• • • Everything goes there. </ta><ta id="Seg_2065" s="T84" e="T85">Listen, oh, leftover chocolate, give it to the pig. </ta><ta id="Seg_2066" s="T85" e="T108">• What should I do with this chilly? </ta><ta id="Seg_2067" s="T108" e="T86">Give it to the pig as well. </ta><ta id="Seg_2068" s="T109" e="T87">And what else is there? </ta><ta id="Seg_2069" s="T110" e="T111">The enormous pigs. </ta><ta id="Seg_2070" s="T111" e="T112">That's how it is. </ta><ta id="Seg_2071" s="T112" e="T88">• ((incromprehensible)) </ta><ta id="Seg_2072" s="T89" e="T113">That's not water! </ta><ta id="Seg_2073" s="T113" e="T1">That's not water! </ta></annotation><annotation name="de" tierref="TIE2"><ta id="Seg_2074" s="T0" e="T5">Hallo, ich habe es heute für sehr wichtig gehalten mit Ihnen über ein Thema zu sprechen, • dass mir vor Kurzem auffiel, nämlich. </ta><ta id="Seg_2075" s="T5" e="T13">• • Haben Sie schon mal bemerkt (wie), • manchmal, • • in einer gegebenen Situation, • • eine Person mit einem bestimmten Verhalten erscheint, • • welches nicht zu der Situation passt, in der sie sich befindet! </ta><ta id="Seg_2076" s="T13" e="T14">((lacht)) </ta><ta id="Seg_2077" s="T15" e="T114">Jetzt habe ich mein Thema vergessen. </ta><ta id="Seg_2078" s="T114" e="T16">Ich erinn/ • erinner mich nich an mein Thema, • ähm, </ta><ta id="Seg_2079" s="T17" e="T18">weil ich verstört bin. </ta><ta id="Seg_2080" s="T18" e="T20">• • Mich hat das Folgende verstört. </ta><ta id="Seg_2081" s="T20" e="T23">• • • Es ist heutzutage sehr schwierig, • Pommes, die nach Pommes schmecken, zu finden. </ta><ta id="Seg_2082" s="T23" e="T2">• • Es ist wirklich schwierig. </ta><ta id="Seg_2083" s="T2" e="T29">• • Es gibt Pommes, die nach Käse schmecken, • • Pommes, die nach Zwiebeln schmecken, • • Pommes, die nach Schinken schmecken, Pommes die nach Barbecue schmecken. </ta><ta id="Seg_2084" s="T29" e="T33">• • Aber, ähm, Pommes, die nach einer guten Kartoffel schmecken zu finden, ist sehr • • schwierig. </ta><ta id="Seg_2085" s="T33" e="T35">• • Und dann habe ich Pommes mit Barbecue Geschmack in Frage gestellt. </ta><ta id="Seg_2086" s="T35" e="T95">Nein. </ta><ta id="Seg_2087" s="T95" e="T96">• • Nein, nein. </ta><ta id="Seg_2088" s="T96" e="T36">• Auf keinen Fall! </ta><ta id="Seg_2089" s="T36" e="T38">• • Nein, weil sie einem nicht sagen, ob es gegrillter Fisch oder gegrilltes Fleisch ist, oder ob e/es gegrilltes Hühnchen ist. </ta><ta id="Seg_2090" s="T38" e="T39">Nein, es ist nur Barbecue. </ta><ta id="Seg_2091" s="T39" e="T40">• Nun, ein Barbecue, ist etwas, äh, in dem man Sachen grillen kann. </ta><ta id="Seg_2092" s="T40" e="T42">• • Ne?</ta><ta id="Seg_2093" s="T42" e="T44">• • Und so schmecken die Kartoffeln. </ta><ta id="Seg_2094" s="T44" e="T46">• • • Ähm, man könnte also auch sagen, dass es n/ Kartoffeln mit Rauchgeschmack sind. </ta><ta id="Seg_2095" s="T46" e="T47">• Ähm, Kartoffeln, die nach Rauch schmecken. </ta><ta id="Seg_2096" s="T47" e="T48">• Leg es auf den Grill, • und die Leute werden es essen. </ta><ta id="Seg_2097" s="T48" e="T52">• • • Und das ist das Gleiche mit all/ , • allem Essen heutzutage, Essen, das nach anderem Essen schmeckt, • • überall, • • überall. </ta><ta id="Seg_2098" s="T52" e="T92">• • • Ähm, • Wasser! </ta><ta id="Seg_2099" s="T92" e="T55">• Das Wasser von heute, ähm, • Wasser • mit Erbeergeschmack. </ta><ta id="Seg_2100" s="T55" e="T94">• Nein! </ta><ta id="Seg_2101" s="T94" e="T56">• • Nein! </ta><ta id="Seg_2102" s="T56" e="T97">• • Nicht ins Wasser! </ta><ta id="Seg_2103" s="T97" e="T57">Hören Sie zu! </ta><ta id="Seg_2104" s="T57" e="T58">• Wasser ist nur/ nur eine Sache für die Herrschaften des Wassers. </ta><ta id="Seg_2105" s="T58" e="T61">• • • Okay, • Wasser, • • Wasser. </ta><ta id="Seg_2106" s="T61" e="T98">• • • Wörterbuch. </ta><ta id="Seg_2107" s="T98" e="T63">• Wasser, • Wasser. </ta><ta id="Seg_2108" s="T63" e="T65">• • Eine farblose, transparente, geschmacklose und geruchlose Flüssigkeit. </ta><ta id="Seg_2109" s="T65" e="T64">Das bedeutet, man schmeckt nichts und riecht nichts. </ta><ta id="Seg_2110" s="T64" e="T99">• Wasser mit Geschmack? </ta><ta id="Seg_2111" s="T99" e="T66">Nein! </ta><ta id="Seg_2112" s="T66" e="T68">• • • Ah, und diese Sorte, die Geschmack hat, ist kein Wasser. </ta><ta id="Seg_2113" s="T68" e="T93">• • • Wonach schmeckt dieses Wasser? </ta><ta id="Seg_2114" s="T93" e="T70">Nach nichts, es ist Wasser. </ta><ta id="Seg_2115" s="T70" e="T100">• • • Und welchen Geschmack hat es? </ta><ta id="Seg_2116" s="T100" e="T101">Erdbeere? </ta><ta id="Seg_2117" s="T101" e="T72">Das ist kein Wasser! </ta><ta id="Seg_2118" s="T72" e="T73">• • Das ist kein Wasser! </ta><ta id="Seg_2119" s="T73" e="T74"> • • • Wasser mit Geschmack • • ist kein Wasser. </ta><ta id="Seg_2120" s="T74" e="T75">• • • Pft, • • das ist kein Wasser! </ta><ta id="Seg_2121" s="T75" e="T102">• • Das ist kein Wasser! </ta><ta id="Seg_2122" s="T102" e="T103">• • Das ist kein • Wasser! </ta><ta id="Seg_2123" s="T103" e="T76">• • Verstanden? </ta><ta id="Seg_2124" s="T76" e="T78">• • • Zum Beispiel gibt es jetzt Joghurt, Schokoladenjoghurt mit • • Tabasco Geschmack. </ta><ta id="Seg_2125" s="T78" e="T3">• ((lacht)) </ta><ta id="Seg_2126" s="T3" e="T104">Oh, welch Kultiviertheit, welch Kultiviertheit, • scharfe Schokolade. </ta><ta id="Seg_2127" s="T104" e="T105">Klar, das ist kultiviert. </ta><ta id="Seg_2128" s="T105" e="T80">Es ist es nicht. </ta><ta id="Seg_2129" s="T80" e="T106">• Es ist nicht kultiviert. </ta><ta id="Seg_2130" s="T106" e="T107">Es ist eine Schweinerei. </ta><ta id="Seg_2131" s="T107" e="T81">• • • Verstanden? </ta><ta id="Seg_2132" s="T81" e="T82">• • Wissen Sie wo diese Kultiviertheit noch angetroffen werden kann, diese Mischung von Geschmäckern? </ta><ta id="Seg_2133" s="T82" e="T83">• • An Orten an denen Schweine essen. </ta><ta id="Seg_2134" s="T83" e="T84">• • • Da geht alles hin. </ta><ta id="Seg_2135" s="T84" e="T85">Hey, oh, es ist Schokolade übriggeblieben, gib sie dem Schwein. </ta><ta id="Seg_2136" s="T85" e="T108">• Was soll ich mit dieser Chilli machen? </ta><ta id="Seg_2137" s="T108" e="T86">Gib sie auch dem Schwein. </ta><ta id="Seg_2138" s="T109" e="T87">Und was ist da noch? </ta><ta id="Seg_2139" s="T110" e="T111">Riesige Schweine. </ta><ta id="Seg_2140" s="T111" e="T112">So ist das. </ta><ta id="Seg_2141" s="T112" e="T88">• ((unverständlich)) </ta><ta id="Seg_2142" s="T89" e="T113">Es ist kein Wasser! </ta><ta id="Seg_2143" s="T113" e="T1">Es ist kein Wasser! </ta></annotation></segmented-tier><segmented-tier id="TIE3" category="nn" type="d" display-name="[nn]"><segmentation name="Event" tierref="TIE3"><ats n="e" id="Seg_2144" s="T14" e="T15">((1,0s)) </ats><ats n="e" id="Seg_2145" s="T16" e="T17">((1,0s))</ats><ats n="e" id="Seg_2146" s="T86" e="T109">((1,3s))</ats><ats n="e" id="Seg_2147" s="T87" e="T110">((1,5s))</ats><ats n="e" id="Seg_2148" s="T88" e="T89">((4,0s))</ats></segmentation></segmented-tier></segmented-body><conversion-info><basic-transcription-conversion-info><conversion-timeline><conversion-tli id="T0"/><conversion-tli id="T5"/><conversion-tli id="T13"/><conversion-tli id="T14"/><conversion-tli id="T15"/><conversion-tli id="T114"/><conversion-tli id="T16"/><conversion-tli id="T17"/><conversion-tli id="T18"/><conversion-tli id="T20"/><conversion-tli id="T23"/><conversion-tli id="T2"/><conv